build/
# Simulation and synthesis output. The repository carries sources; a build directory, a
# waveform or a result file is regenerated by the set that produced it and is never
# committed. Verilator names its build directory from SIM_BUILD, which the sets set to
# sb_*, sg_*, sd_* and sc_*, and it writes a 67 MB precompiled header into each, so an
# unignored set of arms reaches gigabytes.
sim_build*/
sb[_0-9]*/
sg[_0-9]*/
sd[_0-9]*/
sc[_0-9]*/
sbchk/
obj_dir/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.Xil/
*.vcd
*.fst
*.ghw
*.wdb
*.wlf
results*.xml
res_*.xml
sc*_*.xml
*.jou
*.str
xsim.dir/
